  <prompt>Replace PlaceholderInvariantVerifier's I5 branch with a real probe asserting the token-acquisition path carries an explicit tenantId (probing against Graph with a per-tenant authority), confirming no ambient/default-tenant token acquisition is possible for the provisioning flow.</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in H13's IE2ETrapVerifier/IE2EInvariantVerifier seam contracts and typed Azure SDK/REST post-condition verification.</role>

  <goal>I5's real verifier confirms Graph token acquisition for the provisioning flow is always tenant-scoped explicitly, returning Fail if a default/ambient-tenant token path is detected.</goal>

