  <constraints>
    <constraint source="DS-4 §6 H13 placeholder deep-dive">This probe replaces a Placeholder verifier that currently returns InfraFault UNCONDITIONALLY for every subject -- the fix is a REAL check, not a different flavor of always-pass. A live probe asserting explicit per-tenant Graph authority is used for token acquisition in the provisioning flow, complementing the Wave C6 I5 ArchTest's static-scan coverage with a runtime check.</constraint>
    <constraint source="DS-4 §6 pipelining note">H13 probes are buildable pipelined alongside their subject handler's wave, not serialized to the end -- this task can be authored as soon as its subject handler (cited in &lt;deps&gt;) lands, even though it is NUMBERED in the G-7 acceptance range for readability.</constraint>
